 Lady. Want to bet the &#39;suspicious substances&#39; were her spice rack and bag of frozen parsley in the freezer?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116430051176402376/comments/default/116430623403974080'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116430051176402376/comments/default/116430623403974080'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/review-of-news-november-23.html?showComment=1164306180000#c116430623403974080' title=''/><author><name>bunabayashi</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00305667766148789504</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/review-of-news-november-23.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116430051176402376' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116430051176402376' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1408710726"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 23, 2006 at 11:23 AM"/></entry></feed>